# Production lever set of the deployed server (Qwen3.8-27B-ABLITERATED GPTQ-Int8 + Clef, 2x V100 32 GB).
#
# Generated from the environment of the running production api_server on 2026-10-12 (after the
# Clef rollout; the Clef record limit of 32,768 tokens, images in Clef records and
# FA2SM70_MM_DRAFT_SHIFT were added on 2026-10-13; FA2SM70_KEEP_BUFS, FA2SM70_SELBUF_PROBE and FA2SM70_DRAFT_GUARD on 2026-10-14;
# FA2SM70_UNIFORM_PREFILL_FIX on 2026-10-18; FA2SM70_KV_OFFLOAD* on 2026-10-16, off; on 2026-10-19 the fixes verified
# on the test pair: FA2SM70_BLKMEAN_ALL, FA2SM70_PAD_META_FIX, FA2SM70_FREE_UNHASHED_HEAD,
# FA2SM70_NO_SPEC_BLOCKS_MAXTOK1, FA2SM70_CLEF_A1, and Clef records of 34,816 tokens with 4 slots).
# Every value below is exactly what production runs with; scripts/serve_qwen38_clef.sh
# sources this file and then sets the machine-specific variables itself:
#   FA2SM70_PATH, FA2SM70_BUILD_DIR, FA2SM70_CVD, FA2SM70_W12_CACHE, FA2SM70_CLEF_DIR,
#   VLLM_CACHE_ROOT (fingerprinted), FA2SM70_EXCH12 (chosen from the GPU topology).
# Most levers are documented next to the code that reads them (grep the name under vllm/ and sm70/);
# docs/sm70/LEVERS.md explains the ones that change the computation. Change one at a time and re-run the
# gates in docs/sm70/VALIDATION.md.
